{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4f20e1c1a50ddfd1","name":"Corellian YU-410 Light Freighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-4f20e1c1a50ddfd1","title":"Corellian YU-410 Light Freighter","revision":20850,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:38:46Z","sha256":"530a5261bef9fd55a45902523668aaebdce70474d65d5f63d73a1824dc0d3939","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20850","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20YU-410%20Light%20Freighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4f20e1c1a50ddfd1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Another popular design from the Corellian Engineering Corporation, the YU-410 Light Freighter's name is a bit of a misnomer. Considerably larger than typical light freighters, the YU-410 holds an impressive 250 tons of cargo in its spacious twin cargo bays. As a cost-cutting measure, the corporation includes smaller-than-normal engines, giving the YU-410 a low maximum velocity and poor maneuverability. To compensate for the lack of speed, the YU-410 has stronger shields and Double ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," to defend itself against attack- often more than enough to dissuade pirates from assaulting the vessel.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Merchants and mercenaries love the YU-410's cargo capacity and relatively low profile. Most convert some of the cargo space into bigger and better living quarters, turning the YU-410 into a mobile base of operations and relying on more heavily armed escorts for defense. Its ubiquitous design makes repairs simple and parts easy to find at any spaceport, even those in the most far-flung corners of the galaxy. Cavernous cargo bays make the YU-410 Light Freighter a smuggler's dream, with plenty of nooks and crannies in which to store illicit merchandise. This gives a +5 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks for the purposes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealing Items"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealing_Items"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Corellian YU-410 Light Freighter Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -5; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 12 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 26; +12 Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 120; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 20; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 76\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Fly 12 Squares (",{"tag":"a","chil